Audit Rules:
  [AR1] Compare external capabilities against internal skills
  [AR2] Identify gaps and overlaps
  [AR3] Propose integration only for superior external components
  [AR4] Never blindly merge external into internal
  [AR5] Maintain internal system priority

State: +
